<!--
     SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
     Copyright 2026 The DiamaneOS Project

     Privileged permissions of the stock Qualcomm system_ext telephony apps,
     which keep their stock signature (they are not signed with our platform
     key). Every signature|privileged permission they request is listed, as
     granted or explicitly denied; with ro.control_privapp_permissions=enforce
     an unlisted one stops a user build at boot (AppIdPermissionPolicy).

     org.codeaurora.ims (IMS/VoLTE). Granted, each needed on the VoLTE path:
       MODIFY_PHONE_STATE, READ_PRIVILEGED_PHONE_STATE, READ_PRECISE_PHONE_STATE:
         ImsService registration, call and SMS control.
       INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS: ImsServiceSub.broadcastVopsSsacIntent
         (sendBroadcastAsUser) and sendBroadcastForDisconnected
         (sendStickyBroadcastAsUser) call it outside any try block.
     Denied:
       WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS: its only writes are gated on state that does not
         exist on this product. ImsService.migrateDb writes only when
         Settings.Global "rtt_mode" is set (getInt(..., -1) != -1), a key only
         Qualcomm's own settings apps write; ImsServiceSub.processShowVoWifiNtf
         writes only when the carrier config key orange_new_feature_enabled is
         true, which the AOSP carrier config does not define.
       SUBSTITUTE_NOTIFICATION_APP_NAME: only relabels its notifications.
     Not grantable without the platform key and not needed for VoLTE:
     CREATE_USERS, INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS_FULL, INTERACT_ACROSS_PROFILES,
     SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW.

     com.qualcomm.qti.telephonyservice (QCRIL audio messenger), installed as a
     privileged app so that its shared UID android.uid.qtiphone is privileged
     and a non-privileged package cannot join it. Granted:
       MODIFY_AUDIO_ROUTING: its AudioController calls
         AudioManager.setAudioServerStateCallback and isAudioServerRunning,
         which AudioService allows only with MODIFY_PHONE_STATE or
         MODIFY_AUDIO_ROUTING. Without it the app crashes at start, QCRIL has
         no audio client and calls have no audio. Stock grants it by
         signature. The app has no INTERNET permission.
-->
<permissions>
    <privapp-permissions package="org.codeaurora.ims">
        <permission name="android.permission.MODIFY_PHONE_STATE"/>
        <permission name="android.permission.READ_PRECISE_PHONE_STATE"/>
        <permission name="android.permission.READ_PRIVILEGED_PHONE_STATE"/>
        <permission name="android.permission.INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS"/>
        <deny-permission name="android.permission.WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS"/>
        <deny-permission name="android.permission.SUBSTITUTE_NOTIFICATION_APP_NAME"/>
    </privapp-permissions>
    <privapp-permissions package="com.qualcomm.qti.telephonyservice">
        <permission name="android.permission.MODIFY_AUDIO_ROUTING"/>
    </privapp-permissions>
</permissions>
